# Floors (docs/guide/concepts-floors.md).
title: A floor is a fixed check that no model can talk its way past
direction: down
pr: The pull request's head commit
floors: Floors: coverage, security, secrets, dependencies, accessibility, speed
hold: Every floor holds: review can go on
miss: One floor misses: the merge is blocked
waiver: Only a recorded waiver lets it through
pr -> floors
floors -> hold: hold
floors -> miss: miss
miss -> waiver
